    "Koj cov khaub ncaws zoo nkauj heev.": ["Koj cov khaub ncaws zoo nkauj heev.","Ua tsaug, kuv niam xaws.","Your clothes are beautiful. / Thanks, my mom sewed them."],
    "Zoo siab hnub yug.": ["Zoo siab hnub yug, Paj!","Ua tsaug!","Happy birthday, Paj! / Thank you!"],
    "Tag kis lawv hu plig.": ["Tag kis lawv ua dab tsi?","Tag kis lawv hu plig.","What are they doing tomorrow? / Tomorrow they're holding a soul calling."],
    "Kuv yog xeem Vang.": ["Koj yog xeem dab tsi?","Kuv yog xeem Vang.","What's your clan? / I'm a Vang."],
    "Nov yog kuv tus txiv.": ["Nov yog kuv tus txiv.","Zoo siab tau ntsib koj.","This is my husband. / Nice to meet you."],
