    "Koj xav noj dab tsi?": ["Koj xav noj dab tsi?","Kuv xav noj fawm.","What do you want to eat? / I want to eat pho."],
    "Nws yog leej twg?": ["Nws yog leej twg?","Nws yog kuv tus phooj ywg.","Who is she? / She's my friend."],
    "Koj yuav mus thaum twg?": ["Koj yuav mus thaum twg?","Kuv yuav mus tag kis.","When are you going? / I'm going tomorrow."],
    "Koj xav haus kav fes los yog tshuaj yej?": ["Koj xav haus kav fes los yog tshuaj yej?","Kuv xav haus tshuaj yej.","Would you like coffee or tea? / I'd like tea."],
    "No hu li cas?": ["No hu li cas?","No hu ua qeej.","What's this called? / It's called a qeej."],
    "Kuv zoo siab.": ["Kuv zoo siab.","Kuv kuj zoo siab.","I'm happy. / I'm happy too."],
    "Nov yog kuv tus nus.": ["Nov yog leej twg?","Nov yog kuv tus nus.","Who is this? / This is my brother."],
    "Kuv muaj ib lub kaus.": ["Koj puas muaj lub kaus?","Kuv muaj ib lub kaus.","Do you have an umbrella? / I have one umbrella."],
