      {"t":"order","p":"Build: I don't understand","a":["Kuv","tsis","nkag","siab"],"x":["tshis"],"why":"tsis has no puff of air; the aspirated tshis is goat."},
      {"t":"fill","q":"Kuv __ paub.","p":"I don't know.","a":["tsis"],"o":["tsib","tshis","txhob"],"why":"Not is tsis, before the verb. tsib is five and tshis is goat."},
      {"t":"fill","q":"Tsis __ mus.","p":"Don't go.","a":["txhob"],"o":["txob","tau","yog"],"why":"Don't is tsis txhob; txob is pepper, and tsis tau mus would be hasn't gone yet."},
      {"t":"fill","q":"Kuv tsis __ noj mov.","p":"I haven't eaten yet.","a":["tau"],"o":["txhob","yog","ntau"],"why":"Not yet is tsis tau. ntau, with a nasal start, means many."},
      {"t":"type","p":"Type: I don't know","a":["kuv tsis paub"],"hint":"kuv · tsis · paub · not goes before the verb","x":["tsib"],"why":"tsis (not) has the low tone letter -s and goes before the verb; tsib is five."},
      {"t":"type","p":"Type: Don't go! (use tsis txhob)","a":["tsis txhob mus"],"hint":"tsis txhob · mus","x":["txob","tsib"],"why":"txhob is aspirated, with a puff of air; txob means pepper. tsis (not) has the low tone letter -s; tsib is five."},
      {"t":"type","p":"Type: I don't understand (use nkag siab)","a":["kuv tsis nkag siab"],"hint":"kuv · tsis · nkag siab","x":["tshis","tsib"],"why":"tsis goes before the verb; the aspirated tshis would be goat, and tsib, with the high tone, is five."}
