      {"t":"order","p":"Please help me.","a":["Thov","pab","kuv"],"x":["kub"],"why":"kuv (me) has the rising tone, letter v; kub with the high tone is \"hot\"."},
      {"t":"order","p":"Could you say it again?","a":["Hais","dua","puas","tau"],"x":["pua"],"why":"puas has the low tone (tone letter s); pua with no tone letter means \"hundred\"."},
      {"t":"order","p":"Don't go.","a":["Tsis","txhob","mus"],"x":["puas"],"why":"tsis txhob comes before the verb: Tsis txhob mus."},
      {"t":"fill","q":"Thov __ kuv.","p":"Please help me.","a":["pab"],"o":["pob","pom","paj"],"why":"pab is to help; pob is a ball, pom is to see, and paj, with the tone letter j, is flower."},
      {"t":"fill","q":"Tsis __ noj.","p":"Don't eat.","a":["txhob"],"o":["thov","puas","tau"],"why":"tsis txhob + verb means don't."},
      {"t":"fill","q":"Kuv nug puas __?","p":"May I ask?","a":["tau"],"o":["tais","tag","lawm"],"why":"The tag is puas tau, with tau, not tais (bowl) or tag."},
      {"t":"type","p":"Please help me.","a":["Thov pab kuv"],"hint":"thov (please) · pab (help) · kuv (me)","x":["kub"],"why":"kuv has the rising tone (tone letter v); kub, with the high tone, means \"hot\"."},
      {"t":"type","p":"Please sit down. (soften it with os)","a":["Thov zaum os"],"hint":"thov · zaum (sit) · os","x":["zaus"],"why":"zaum (sit) has the creaky tone, letter m; zaus with the low tone means \"a time, an occasion\"."},
      {"t":"type","p":"Could you help me? (use puas tau)","a":["Pab kuv puas tau","Koj pab kuv puas tau"],"hint":"pab (help) · kuv (me) · puas tau","x":["pua"],"why":"puas ends in the tone letter s (low tone); pua means \"hundred\"."}
